            },
            "body": "A second exact H200 job in the same nightly independently hit the identical startup boundary:\n\n- [Rust Frontend Core Correctness](https://buildkite.com/vllm/ci/builds/88685#01a09c93-310e-443f-a3e6-a0f0907dc6a6) on `h200-ci-5-5` reached `RemoteOpenAIServer`'s 480-second health timeout while CUDA-graph capture was still progressing, then failed with `Server failed to start in time`.\n\nThis job invokes the same `test_lm_eval_accuracy_v1_engine` case, so the scoped 600-second wait in this PR covers both recurrences. Lightweight checks are green; exact H200 validation and human line review are still required before promotion.\n",
